  "problem": "Consider the vector space $C[0,1]$ of all continuous functions $f:[0,1]\\to R$ and its subset $G=\\{f\\in C[0,1]\\,|\\,f(0)\\ge 0\\}.$ \n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nI. $G$ is closed under function addition\n\nII. $G$ is closed under scalar multiplication\n\nIII. $G$ is a subspace of $C[0,1]$\n\nIV. $G$ is **not** a subspace of $C[0,1]$",
